    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella,Minister of Higher Educations and Highways, do by this Order, on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission,amend the Schedule to the Order establishing the University of Jaffna, Sri Lanka, which is deemed, by virtue of theprovisions of Section 139 of the aforesaid Act, to be an order made under Section 21 of the aforesaid Act, (as lastamended by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary, No. 1819/27 of July 18, 2013) by the addition immediately afterthe entry \u201cFaculty of Engineering\u201d appearing in Column I and its corresponding entries in Column II thereof, of thefollowing :-",
